{4}{[ Phoenix Journal ]}
{5}{News that matters to you.}

// filler articles
{10}{492c _ WEATHER _}
{11}{483l It's gonna be a warm one, folks. A mild summer is quickly shifting to a hot summer, and we're going to see sun all week long.}
{12}{492c _ FUN FACT _}
{13}{483l Did you know that in Asia, an estimated 2300 puppies are killed every minute for food?}
{14}{492c _ PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT _}
{15}{483l There will be a zoning commission meeting to discuss the impact of the proximity of government facilities upon property values, and specifically the nuclear missile silos being erected in nearby Chickawa County. Cont. B4}
{16}{492c _ JOE'S SHOES SUPERSALE _}
{17}{483l Joe's is overstocked! Come see us today for the best deals in shoes, galoshes, boots, sneakers, sandals, and athleticwear.}
{18}{492c _ ESCAPED FELON ALERT _}
{19}{483l Authorities released a warning to press today stating that serial killer Jack LaRue has escaped confinement and is considered armed and dangerous. Cont. B-2}
{20}{492c _ LOCAL CHARITY FIREBOMBED _}
{21}{483l Mourners gathered last night for a candlelight vigil outside the ruins of the Good Sisters Shelter, which was burned nearly to the ground earlier this week. Authorities strongly suspect that the blaze was chemically accelerated, which implies arson. Why anyone would burn an empty charity collection center to the ground is something the authorities aren't sure of yet.}
{22}{492c _ COOKING CORNER _}
{23}{483l Today we'll discuss how to broil a hamburger. Or maybe boil it. I always get those two confused. They sound a lot the same and are both cooking related, so it's understandable, right? I mean, I'm not a total idiot or anything, right? Well, that's it for today folks, check out tomorrow's column where we discuss microwaved hotdogs.}
{24}{492c _ YOUR RIGHTS _}
{25}{483l ACLU in uproar over bill to give life imprisonment for marijauna possession. The bill was introduced last February and is expected to make it through the House. Cont. C-7}

