{1002}{483l And here's the text of the story. It's pretty exciting!}


{1010}{490c Clash of the Titans! Nuclear powers hostile!}
{1011}{492c _ War looms imminent as Nuclear Powers Grow Tense _}
{1012}{483l The Chinese Ambassador to the U.S. has threatened to close off its border and with them, a good portion of the trade routes through the east if the U.S. continues to develop anti-missile shield technology while refusing to dismantle existing arms. The Chinese government has made its opinion of the US' actions very clear: "To continue on this path is to guarantee war!" Will the US reinstate dismantling of their nuclear arms? Will China accept the idea of a planet where a single power is immune to nuclear attack? Perhaps the UN Council meeting next Tuesday will tell.}

//Generic Newspapers

